# The four prompt sets are not stored in git. Fetch them from the pinned Hugging Face dataset revision with
#   python data/download.py
# or rebuild them byte for byte from public sources with data/build/build_data.py (see README.md).
/student/train_3domain.jsonl
/teacher/math_train.jsonl
/teacher/code_train.jsonl
/teacher/if_train.jsonl
# Staging area of download.py (removed after a successful download).
/.download/
# The build scripts are tracked (the root .gitignore ignores build/ directories); their download cache is not.
!build/
build/cache/
*.tmp
*.part
